msgid "Set the same token on every box and put this box's IP into Master on the others, tick \"follow\" there: each follower then announces itself every N seconds and this box lists it above. Start a job here and every announced node joins automatically - the source is cut into keyframe-aligned pieces, every box encodes one, this box joins them. Stop stops all workers."
msgstr "每台设备填相同的密钥，并在其他设备的“主机”里填本机 IP、勾上“跟随主机”：跟随者每 N 秒上报一次，就会出现在上面的列表里。在本机点开始，所有已上报节点自动加入：源按关键帧切段，每台编码一段，本机拼接。点停止会停掉所有工作节点。"

msgid "Effect and GIF work with the shipped transcoder (flip/rotate run on the RGA, black and white keeps the hardware encoder). Resync rebuilds the video clock from the frame index and forces a constant frame rate - that is the fix for \"plays fine, then the audio drifts, seeking helps\"; the audio side needs the aresample filter, the backend says so when it is missing. Logo and picture in picture need the overlay filter as well. Cluster mode uses the effect, the other options are ignored."
msgstr "特效和 GIF 现在就能用（翻转/旋转走 RGA 硬件，黑白保留硬件编码器）。重定时按帧序号重建视频时间轴并强制恒定帧率——“开头好好的，几分钟后音画不同步、快进一下又好”就是这个。音轨侧需要 aresample 滤镜，缺少时后端会直接说明。LOGO 和画中画同样需要 overlay 滤镜。集群模式只用特效，其余选项忽略。"

