msgstr "修复已开始…"

msgid "What it does"
msgstr "做什么了"

msgid "Audio and video keep separate clocks. If the video clock comes from the timestamps of a damaged source, or the audio arrives at a slightly different rate, the sound slowly creeps out of step - the classic \"starts fine, drifts after a few minutes, seeking helps for a moment\". Repair rebuilds the video timeline from the frame index (constant frame rate, regenerated timestamps, no re-scaling) and re-encodes the audio with aresample=async so it is glued to that clock. Pixels are not touched and no effect is applied. Measured on this box: a 20.400 s video against 20.000 s of audio comes out as 20.020 s / 20.010 s, 600 frames, 0 decode errors."
msgstr "音频和视频各自走自己的时钟。如果视频时钟来自损坏源的时间戳，或者音频到达的码率微微不对，声音就会慢慢跑偏——就是那个“开头好好的，几分钟后开始不对，拖一下进度又好一会儿”。修复按帧序号重建视频时间轴（恒定帧率、重生成时间戳、不重新缩放），并用 aresample=async 重编码音轨，把它钉在这个时钟上。像素不动，也不应用特效。本机实测：20.400 秒视频对 20.000 秒音频，修复后 20.020 / 20.010 秒，600 帧，0 解码错误。"

msgid "This source is %sx%s: decoding it needs about 300 MB of contiguous DMA memory and the video pool is only %s MB, so the VPU never gets its buffers (measured: mpp_dma_heap \"alloc failed\", then the job sits at 0% for ever). Downscaling does not help - the source is decoded at full size first. Use a 1080p source, or raise rk_video_cma= (e.g. rk_video_cma=512M) in the bootargs."
msgstr "这个源是 %sx%s：解码它需要约 300 MB 连续 DMA 内存，而视频专用池只有 %s MB，VPU 拿不到缓存（实测：mpp_dma_heap “alloc failed”，任务就永远停在 0%）。降分辨率没用——源是先按原尺寸解码的。请用 1080p 片源，或把 bootargs 里的 rk_video_cma= 调大（例如 rk_video_cma=512M）。"

msgid "This source is %sx%s: decoding it needs about 300 MB of contiguous DMA memory and the video pool is only %s MB, so the VPU never gets its buffers. Downscaling does not help. Use a 1080p source, or raise rk_video_cma= (e.g. rk_video_cma=512M) in the bootargs."
msgstr "这个源是 %sx%s：解码需要约 300 MB 连续 DMA 内存，视频专用池只有 %s MB，VPU 拿不到缓存。降分辨率没用。请用 1080p 片源，或把 rk_video_cma= 调大（如 rk_video_cma=512M）。"

msgid "Nothing was decoded in %ss: the hardware decoder never got a frame. A 4K stream needs about 300 MB of contiguous DMA memory and the video pool is %s MB - if the log shows mpp_dma_heap \"alloc failed\" the pool was full (another process holding it, or a bigger stream), otherwise the source stopped delivering data. Use a 1080p source, enlarge rk_video_cma= in the bootargs, or check the stream."
msgstr "%s 秒内一帧都没解出来：硬件解码器始终没拿到帧。4K 流需要约 300 MB 连续 DMA 内存，而视频专用池是 %s MB——如果日志里是 mpp_dma_heap “alloc failed”，说明池已满（被别的进程占了，或者流更大）；否则就是源中途不发数据了。请用 1080p 源、把 bootargs 里的 rk_video_cma= 调大，或检查流。"
